accTitle: "NutsNews Public Page Translation Update"
accDescr: "This update extends the existing web language preference beyond the home feed."
flowchart TD
  A[User changes language in Settings] --> B[Emit nutsnews:language-change]
  B --> C[useSelectedLanguage captures new selection]
  C --> D[Store selected value in localStorage `nutsnews.web.language`]
  D --> E[Public pages read selected language at runtime]
  E --> F[Render About/Contact/Privacy/Footer content in selected language]
  E --> G[Keep page metadata (SEO/server metadata) in English]

